  sentences:
    nameNPC: "L\xEDnh tr\u1EBB"
    Lines:
    - "Lao xuy\xEAn khi\xEAn, \u0111\xE8 nghi\u1EBFn ng\u1EF1c. M\xE1u \u1EA5m tr\xE0o.
      Ti\u1EBFng k\xE8n \u201Ckh\xF3a h\u1EADu\u201D b\u1ECB ch\xE9m \u0111\u1EE9t
      gi\u1EEFa ch\u1EEBng. G\xF3c nh\xECn nghi\xEAng \u0111\u1ED5. C\u1EDD r\u01A1i,
      b\xF9n \u0111\u1ECF loang."
    - "\u0110\xE3 qu\xE1 v\u1ED9i vang, qu\xE2n l\u1EF1c c\xF2n thi\u1EBFu, s\u1EF1c
      ng\u01B0\u1EDDi c\xF2n ch\u01B0a \u0111\u1EE7."
    - "G\xF2 m\u1EA5t. Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi m\u1EA5t. \xDD ch\xED m\u1EA5t."
